%% DRAFT (Slice 0b) capture loop owned by S2; called inside Phase 1, at prototype notes, and by the Phase 4 scribe.
flowchart TD
    In["Approved Discovery Plan<br/>and confirmed session brief"] --> Frame["Pass 1 problem framing<br/>problem, user groups, goals, scope"]
    Frame --> Chk1{{"check_gaps"}}
    Chk1 -->|"too many gaps"| Back(["Return to S1:<br/>refine the brief"])
    Chk1 -->|"ok"| BRD["Pass 2 business requirements<br/>CONFIRMED and UNCONFIRMED markers"]
